        <p class="article-hero__eyebrow article-hero__eyebrow--pill">Our story</p>
        <h2 class="section__h2" style="text-align:left; margin-top:var(--space-sm);">We build the system behind the front desk.</h2>
        <p class="pillar__desc">Across Nepal, spas, salons, studios and clinics run on phone calls, WhatsApp messages, paper diaries and spreadsheets. It works until a second branch opens, a therapist is double-booked, or a discount is given that nobody can trace.</p>
        <p class="pillar__desc">Zennly was launched in 2026 by <a href="https://zunkireelabs.com" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Zunkireelabs</a> in Lalitpur to replace that patchwork with one calm system: online booking, staff and room scheduling, discount approvals, payment tracking and a locked daily reconciliation across every branch.</p>
        <p class="pillar__desc">We started with a real operator, not a demo. Nuad Thai Spa Kathmandu was our first live client, and what we learned running four of its branches shaped the product you see today.</p>
        <a href="/case-study/" class="btn-secondary" style="margin-top:var(--space-xs);">Read the Nuad Thai Spa case study &rarr;</a>
      </div>
      <div class="about-split__visual reveal" data-delay="1">
